.TH VIRT-FW-MEASURE "1" "September 2026" "virt-fw-measure 26.9" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
virt-fw-measure \- manual page for virt-fw-measure 26.9
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B virt-fw-measure
[\fI\,options\/\fR]
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-l\fR LEVEL, \fB\-\-loglevel\fR=\fI\,LEVEL\/\fR
set loglevel to LEVEL
.TP
\fB\-\-image\fR=\fI\,FILE\/\fR
read edk2 image from FILE
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR=\fI\,VER\/\fR
firmware version (PcdFirmwareVersionString)
.TP
\fB\-\-pcrlock\fR
write event log in systemd\-pcrlock format (default)
.TP
\fB\-\-digests\fR
write expected pcr values
.TP
\fB\-\-vars\fR=\fI\,FILE\/\fR
read edk2 vars from FILE
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sb\fR, \fB\-\-no\-secure\-boot\fR
assume secure boot is disabled
.TP
\fB\-\-shim\fR
enable shim variable measurements
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-shim\fR
disable shim variable measurements
.TP
\fB\-\-bank\fR=\fI\,BANKS\/\fR
pick tpm2 banks (sha1, sha256, sha384, sha512),
specify multiple times to select more than one
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"

Gerd Hoffmann <kraxel@redhat.com>
